@globex-payments
(1) Auth: OAuth2 client-credentials. Token endpoint is POST /oauth/token. Access tokens live 30 minutes. I don't have anything in my notes about refresh tokens; with client-credentials you would normally just request a new token, but I can't confirm specifics beyond the 30-minute lifetime.
(2) Webhooks: signed with HMAC-SHA256, signature in the `X-Acme-Signature` header. Failed deliveries are retried with exponential backoff for up to 24 hours. Delivery is at-least-once, so dedupe on `event_id`. I don't know the exact backoff schedule or the signed-payload format.
